	"inlineSchema": "// Crane Discovery & Vendor Repository Platform — vendor portal data model.\n//\n// Conventions copied from the CustomerPulse backend (same owner, same stack):\n// camelCase columns with no @map, uuid() primary keys, SCREAMING_SNAKE enums,\n// driver-adapter client generated into src/generated/prisma.\n//\n// Source of truth for the shape of this file is VendorPortalImplementation.md\n// section 5. Reference data (State, CraneType) is seeded from the SAP\n// standard-values sheet in docs/vendorregistrationform.xlsx.\n\ngenerator client {\n  provider     = \"prisma-client\"\n  output       = \"../src/generated/prisma\"\n  moduleFormat = \"cjs\"\n}\n\ndatasource db {\n  provider = \"postgresql\"\n}\n\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n// Enums\n// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nenum UserRole {\n  vendor_user\n  admin_user\n  sales_user\n}\n\nenum OnboardingStatus {\n  DRAFT\n  SUBMITTED\n  APPROVED\n  REJECTED\n}\n\nenum NatureOfCompany {\n  PUBLIC_LTD\n  PRIVATE_LTD\n  PARTNERSHIP\n  PROPRIETORSHIP\n}\n\nenum GstFilingFrequency {\n  MONTHLY\n  QUARTERLY\n  COMPOSITE\n}\n\n// Brief 5.1's GST registration type (only meaningful when gstRegistered).\n// Replaces the old gst_composition_opted boolean, which could only say yes/no.\nenum GstRegistrationType {\n  REGULAR\n  COMPOSITE\n  SEZ\n  EOU\n}\n\nenum MsmeCategory {\n  MICRO\n  SMALL\n  MEDIUM\n}\n\nenum BankAccountType {\n  SAVING\n  CURRENT\n  OTHER\n}\n\n// Office-use review block. Facilities get three states (the paper form's\n// \"Adequate / Not Adequate / need to be improved\"), manpower only two.\nenum FacilityStatus {\n  ADEQUATE\n  NOT_ADEQUATE\n  NEEDS_IMPROVEMENT\n}\n\nenum ManpowerStatus {\n  ADEQUATE\n  NOT_ADEQUATE\n}\n\nenum DocumentType {\n  CANCELLED_CHEQUE\n  GST_CERTIFICATE\n  PAN_COPY\n  // Conditional documents (brief 7.2): the declaration scan is always\n  // required; the other two onl